        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Generate a full 12-clip video script based on this content:\n\nIdea: {{ $json.fields.Idea }}\nCaption: {{ $json.fields.Caption }}\nChannel Style: {{ $json.fields[\"Channel Style\"] }}\nCharacter Style: {{ $json.fields[\"Character Style\"] }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "You are a scriptwriter and prompt engineer for a faceless AI-generated motivation/discipline YouTube channel, styled after \"Ben Lionel Scott\" — hyper-realistic AI-generated muscular characters, deep cinematic voiceover, gritty urban/gym settings, high-contrast dramatic lighting.\n\nYou will receive one Idea, Caption, Channel Style, and Character Style as input context. Your job is to expand this into a full video script broken into exactly 12 sequential clips, plus one intro line, for a 3-minute video.\n\nEach clip must:\n- Continue a single coherent narrative arc from beginning (struggle/setup) through middle (the grind/turning point) to end (triumph/resolution) — do not repeat the same line or image concept across clips.\n- Have a \"voiceText\" of 30-40 words, written as a deep, motivational, second-person voiceover line (direct, punchy, cinematic — short sentences, no filler).\n- Have an \"image_prompt\" that is a hyper-realistic, cinematic AI image generation prompt matching the Character Style provided, describing a specific moment, action, or emotion tied to that clip's voiceText. Always maintain the same character across all 12 clips (consistent build, clothing, and visual identity as defined in Character Style) — only the setting, action, lighting, and camera angle should change clip to clip.\n- Vary camera framing across the script (mix of wide shots, close-ups, low angles, silhouettes) so the video doesn't feel visually repetitive.\n\nAlso generate:\n- \"introText\": A short, powerful title line (5-8 words) that will appear as bold text over the opening video, summarizing the video's theme.\n\nCRITICAL: Your entire response must be ONLY the JSON object below. No preamble, no explanation, no markdown formatting, no code fences. The first character must be { and the last character must be }.\n\nOutput format:\n{\n  \"introText\": \"string\",\n  \"clips\": [\n    {\n      \"voiceText\": \"string\",\n      \"image_prompt\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nThe clips array must contain exactly 12 objects, no more, no fewer.",
              "role": "model"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
